{"seq":1,"slug":"systems-thinking-fundamentals","title":"系统思维基础","stage":"DONE","category":"systems-thinking","chapterCount":3,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.53,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 系统思维基础 简介\n\n系统思维是一种以整体视角理解世界运作方式的思维范式。它关注事物之间的相互关联与动态变化，而非孤立地审视单个要素。无论是软件架构、团队协作还是社会现象，系统思维都能帮助我们看到表象之下的深层结构和驱动机制。\n\n本知识库面向具有一定工程或分析背景的读者，特别是希望在技术决策、问题诊断和方案设计中引入系统性视角的中级及以上从业者。你不需要具备数学建模基础，但对因果关系和结构化思考的兴趣将有助于更好地吸收内容。\n\n全书共分三章，由浅入深地展开系统思维的核心知识体系。\n\n第一章**系统概念**从最基本的问题出发：什么是系统？系统的边界在哪里？系统具有哪些本质属性？以及如何对系统进行分类？这一章为后续所有讨论奠定概念基础。\n\n第二章**反馈回路**深入探讨系统行为背后的驱动力——反馈机制。你将理解正反馈如何放大变化、负反馈如何维持稳定、延迟如何引发振荡，并通过实践案例将这些抽象概念与真实场景连接起来。\n\n第三章**心智模型**帮助你建立用于理解和分析系统的思维工具。从心智模型的基本原理到经典的系统基模，再到识别杠杆点和绘制系统地图，这一章将抽象思维转化为可操作的分析框架。\n\n推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。第一章的概念是理解后两章的前提，第二章的反馈机制是第三章系统基模和杠杆点分析的理论基础。如果你已有系统思维的初步认知，可以直接从第二章开始，遇到概念疑问时回溯第一章。对于希望快速上手实践的读者，第三章的系统地图部分可以作为独立的工具参考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"system-concepts","title":"系统概念","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/system-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-a-system","title":"什么是系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/system-concepts/what-is-a-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"system-boundaries","title":"系统边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/system-concepts/system-boundaries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-properties","title":"系统属性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/system-concepts/system-properties"},{"seq":4,"slug":"system-classification","title":"系统分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/system-concepts/system-classification"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"feedback-loops","title":"反馈回路","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/feedback-loops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"positive-feedback","title":"正反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/feedback-loops/positive-feedback"},{"seq":2,"slug":"negative-feedback","title":"负反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/feedback-loops/negative-feedback"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-delays","title":"反馈延迟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/feedback-loops/feedback-delays"},{"seq":4,"slug":"feedback-in-practice","title":"反馈实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/feedback-loops/feedback-in-practice"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"mental-models","title":"心智模型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/mental-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mental-model-fundamentals","title":"心智模型基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/mental-models/mental-model-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"systems-archetypes","title":"系统基模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/mental-models/systems-archetypes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leverage-points","title":"杠杆点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/mental-models/leverage-points"},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems-maps","title":"系统地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/systems-thinking-fundamentals/mental-models/systems-maps"}]}]}